WEBVTT

00:04:30.006 --> 00:04:31.156
CH: Absolutely.

00:04:32.815 --> 00:04:39.387
RD: There are four things
that are the driving forces

00:04:39.411 --> 00:04:42.662
of our economy
and our lifestyle and wealth.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:47.390
And the first and most powerful
is productivity,

00:04:47.414 --> 00:04:51.293
which comes from people
learning and inventing

00:04:51.317 --> 00:04:54.568
and doing things well,
just as Marko [Russiver] described.

00:04:55.315 --> 00:04:56.466
OK?

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:58.371
And it grows slowly.

00:04:58.395 --> 00:05:00.934
You know, one or two
or three percent a year.